Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,FLOWRA har mahine naye features release karta hai bug fixes improvements aur naye tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Jab bhi kuch naya aata hai aapko Dashboard ke What's New panel mein dikhega
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,right side mein neeche.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Har entry ke saath ek tag hota hai — NEW purple mein, FIX red mein, IMPROVE blue mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Date bhi dikhti hai, taaki aap dekh saken kab release hua.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aap chahen toh yehi content ek PDF mein bhi download kar sakte hain Resources section se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,FLOWRA Whats New PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yehi PDF aap apni team ke saath share bhi kar sakte hain WhatsApp pe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple aur updated — hamesha.
